79
00:06:17,460 --> 00:06:18,877
Whoa, whoa! Really?

80
00:06:18,960 --> 00:06:21,997
You're serious about taking
part in my training camp?

81
00:06:22,080 --> 00:06:24,837
The swordsman instructor told
me to try something else.

82
00:06:24,920 --> 00:06:26,257
