95
00:07:24,380 --> 00:07:25,580
I can keep going.

96
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:27,940
I acknowledge your efforts.

97
00:07:28,300 --> 00:07:33,124
But what you have acquired is only a slight
improvement of your natural abilities.

98
00:07:33,280 --> 00:07:34,457
Force yourself to continue.

99
00:07:34,540 --> 00:07:36,680
You may very well lose your life.

100
00:07:37,900 --> 00:07:40,020
Sorry, but you'll have to move on.

101
00:07:40,680 --> 00:07:42,621
He toughed it out more than most.

102
00:07:43,060 --> 00:07:45,857
He deserves to be where
his efforts are rewarded.

103
00:07:45,940 --> 00:07:47,705
Please allow me to train here.

104
00:07:47,860 --> 00:07:50,440
You really want to do this, kid? I do!

105
00:07:50,920 --> 00:07:52,180
Well, if you insist.

106
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,830
Okay, here.

107
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:56,560
Hit that stick hanging over there.

108
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,412
