Yeah, yeah, just do it.

110
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,800
And once he misses, I
can tell him to get lost.

111
00:08:03,940 --> 00:08:06,717
I can already tell he's going
to be a huge pain in the...

112
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,506
Um, was that one good enough?

113
00:08:09,180 --> 00:08:10,380
Okay, do it again.

114
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:17,380
There good no no no no I want
nothing to do with this little twerk.

115
00:08:21,160 --> 00:08:24,537
Instructor why am I doing nothing
but throwing rocks at stuff?

116
00:08:24,620 --> 00:08:27,717
Because I just know you're
gonna be too much trouble duh.

117
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:29,220
I want to use a bow.

118
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:39,537
Now get a good grip on
it and stand in position.

119
00:08:39,620 --> 00:08:40,780
A good grip, huh?

120
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,430
Like this?

121
00:08:42,880 --> 00:08:44,500
I am so sorry!

122
00:08:45,420 --> 00:08:47,500
Trouble, trouble, trouble!

123
00:08:51,840 --> 00:08:53,860
Are you serious, kid?

124
00:08:54,020 --> 00:08:56,320
That was the last of my training bows.

125
00:08:56,660 --> 00:08:57,700
Don't break mine.

126
00:08:58,380 --> 00:09:01,040
My bow can handle even the strongest...

127
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:07,780
Just stick to throwing
stones, got it? Okay.

128
