Nobody taught me.

130
00:09:18,300 --> 00:09:20,157
This is just how I've always hunted birds.

131
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:23,593
The super colorful ones that
swoop down and grab rabbits.

132
00:09:25,180 --> 00:09:26,697
You've got to be kidding me.

133
00:09:26,780 --> 00:09:28,380
That's a thunder flash.

134
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:35,897
It's difficult for even the most seasoned
hunter to bring those things down.

135
00:09:35,980 --> 00:09:39,320
Of course, I could totally
do it with my eyes closed.

136
