This is dumb.

137
00:09:44,520 --> 00:09:46,579
There's no point in him being here.

138
00:09:46,720 --> 00:09:48,544
Okay, I think I've seen enough.

139
00:09:48,700 --> 00:09:50,020
Get out of here. Huh?

140
00:09:50,260 --> 00:09:52,077
But I haven't learned anything yet.

141
00:09:52,160 --> 00:09:56,377
I must say, you lack the prudence to
handle any sort of delicate weaponry.

142
00:09:56,460 --> 00:09:57,657
You're good with rocks.

143
00:09:57,740 --> 00:09:58,681
Keep doing that.

144
00:10:01,220 --> 00:10:02,880
Like I said, trouble.

145
00:10:03,560 --> 00:10:05,040
He doesn't need a bow.

146
00:10:05,300 --> 00:10:07,476
That'd be a waste of everyone's time.

147
00:10:11,100 --> 00:10:11,930
Aha.

148
00:10:12,013 --> 00:10:13,437
You must be the kid
I've been hearing about.

149
00:10:13,520 --> 00:10:15,980
Sure, why not? Huh? You mean it?

150
00:10:16,240 --> 00:10:17,140
Come with me.

151
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,920
We will start right away.

152
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:28,260
Sense the enemy's presence and sneak up on
them without making a sound in your step.

153
00:10:29,040 --> 00:10:29,870
Hmm.

154
00:10:32,360 --> 00:10:33,220
He's not bad.

155
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:38,540
Got it!

156
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:41,500
You will have to do better than that!

157
00:10:41,880 --> 00:10:44,821
