rigged along the corridor.

158
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:49,880
Avoid setting off any of the traps and
make your way to this treasure chest.

159
00:10:50,180 --> 00:10:51,780
Avoid all the traps, huh?

160
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:53,200
No problem!

161
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,270
Harry!

162
00:11:08,120 --> 00:11:09,120
Don't go!

163
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:11,750
Incredible.

164
00:11:12,260 --> 00:11:13,777
Although he...

165
00:11:13,860 --> 00:11:16,440
