166
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:21,900
You failed to dismantle the traps, and
your situational awareness is abysmal.

167
00:11:22,100 --> 00:11:24,159
You have no hope of becoming a spy.

168
00:11:24,800 --> 00:11:29,320
That said, this boy has tenacity
that is beyond comparison.

169
00:11:29,600 --> 00:11:31,020
A valuable quality.

170
00:11:31,660 --> 00:11:34,366
If he ever gives up on
becoming an adventurer,

171
00:11:34,460 --> 00:11:38,342
I will extend an invitation to
join the Royal Intelligence Agency.

172
00:11:39,480 --> 00:11:40,360
Oh-ho!

173
00:11:40,860 --> 00:11:43,977
You're quite young to be
applying for this, aren't you?

174
00:11:44,060 --> 00:11:48,400
I'm pretty sure there's an age
requirement of at least 15 years old.

175
00:11:48,500 --> 00:11:50,797
I already got a permit
from the Guildmaster.

176
00:11:50,880 --> 00:11:53,821
I've trained at a bunch
of the other schools, too.

177
00:11:54,280 --> 00:11:55,500
Didn't work out.

178
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:08,997
It seems the reason you
struggle to use magic is because

179
00:12:09,080 --> 00:12:11,737
there's no mono flowing
through you in the first place.

180
00:12:11,820 --> 00:12:13,702
Why does it not flow through me?

181
00:12:13,980 --> 00:12:16,297
Well, perhaps you were just born that way.

182
00:12:16,380 --> 00:12:17,880
In which case then,

183
00:12:18,140 --> 00:12:22,316
the only hope of changing that is to
go inside the mono resonance room.

184
00:12:22,960 --> 00:12:23,920
Rizzo... what?

185
00:12:25,680 --> 00:12:27,327
I'm happy to give it a shot.

186
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:31,540
Well, all right.

187
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:35,766
But leave immediately if it starts
feeling too intense for you.

188
00:12:36,820 --> 00:12:37,650
What?

189
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,500
A boy hasn't come outside yet? No, sir.

190
00:12:40,860 --> 00:12:42,240
Crap, that is not good.

191
00:12:43,020 --> 00:12:45,157
That room drastically amplifies all of the

192
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,717
human senses and he's
been in there for days.

193
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:50,094
It could kill him if we're not careful.

194
00:12:51,580 --> 00:12:52,500
I'm here.

195
00:12:53,340 --> 00:12:54,300
What is it?

196
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:55,660
Are you okay?

197
00:12:56,020 --> 00:12:57,717
Does your body feel all right?

198
00:12:57,800 --> 00:12:58,940
Yeah, I feel fine.

199
00:12:59,380 --> 00:13:01,086
Just a little longer, please.

200
00:13:01,240 --> 00:13:03,357
I think I'm about to have a breakthrough.

201
00:13:03,440 --> 00:13:04,270
What?

202
00:13:08,320 --> 00:13:10,680
This is all I've learned to do.

203
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:15,377
To think you've come this far, yet
all you can manage is tiny flame.

204
00:13:15,460 --> 00:13:20,225
It's extremely rare to see someone as
incapable of magic as you seem to be, Gnor.

205
00:13:22,720 --> 00:13:24,940
Now look, given your lack of mana,

206
00:13:25,240 --> 00:13:28,240
it's actually impressive
how far you've come along.

207
00:13:29,620 --> 00:13:30,450
What?

208
00:13:30,533 --> 00:13:31,800
Am I seeing this right?

209
00:13:32,020 --> 00:13:33,400
Is he dual casting?

210
00:13:33,840 --> 00:13:36,280
It took me 50 years to get to that point,

211
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:39,217
yet he managed it on his
own in just three months.

212
00:13:39,300 --> 00:13:40,700
I'm losing my mind.

213
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:45,058
This won't help me be an adventurer.

214
00:13:47,360 --> 00:13:48,560
Indeed it won't.

215
00:13:49,000 --> 00:13:52,471
Turns out this isn't the right
place for you either, is it?

216
00:13:53,120 --> 00:13:54,180
Such a pity.

217
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,480
The kid has so much talent.

218
00:13:56,820 --> 00:13:59,460
If only his body were
more attuned to magic.

219
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:04,114
He could have been known throughout
the land as an unparalleled magician.

220
00:14:05,880 --> 00:14:07,440
First, let me ask you.

221
00:14:07,900 --> 00:14:11,257
Did you undergo the rite of blessing
when you were a small child?

222
00:14:11,340 --> 00:14:12,237
Rite of blessing?

223
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:13,150
What's that?

224
00:14:13,233 --> 00:14:14,360
At this school,

225
00:14:14,660 --> 00:14:18,437
only those who were selected in advance
and underwent the ceremony can train.

226
00:14:18,520 --> 00:14:19,420
I'm so sorry.

227
00:14:19,940 --> 00:14:20,957
Well, I don't care.

228
00:14:21,040 --> 00:14:23,864
I'm not leaving until you
agree to let me train.

229
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:26,660
Do as you wish.

230
00:14:45,580 --> 00:14:48,933
I'm not leaving until you
agree to let me train with you!

231
00:14:49,900 --> 00:14:50,980
Fine by me.

232
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:01,662
He cannot seriously intend
to stay there forever.

233
00:15:31,340 --> 00:15:34,957
I will allow you to participate
in the basics of our training.

234
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:35,981
Although please,

235
00:15:36,260 --> 00:15:40,495
understand that there is no guarantee
you will actually acquire a skill.

236
00:15:45,700 --> 00:15:50,520
That is most certainly low heal, but
how on earth is this even possible?

237
00:15:51,420 --> 00:15:52,660
Yes, but um...

238
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:55,037
However, unfortunately for you,

239
00:15:55,120 --> 00:15:57,917
low heal won't be
recognized as a serviceable

240
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:00,417
skill to make you an
accredited adventurer.

241
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:01,557
Should have known.

242
00:16:01,640 --> 00:16:02,470
I can't...

243
00:16:02,553 --> 00:16:04,080
I can't do anything.

244
00:16:05,900 --> 00:16:08,018
Although it only works on scratches,

245
00:16:08,200 --> 00:16:10,797
it's still impressive you
can use low-level healing

246
00:16:10,880 --> 00:16:14,233
magic without a natural blessing
already bestowed on you.

247
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:19,080
He performed a miracle all on his own,

248
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:23,144
without undergoing the rite or
using a spirit as an intermediary.

249
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:26,000
Which, in a manner of speaking,

250
00:16:26,500 --> 00:16:29,735
means he can wield the power
of miracles without limit.

251
00:16:33,620 --> 00:16:35,480
Master Sane, about Noor.

252
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,840
He's disappeared from the capital?

253
00:16:40,580 --> 00:16:43,617
I should have stopped him
while I still had the chance.

254
00:16:43,700 --> 00:16:45,720
We can just leave him be, right?

255
00:16:45,960 --> 00:16:48,677
That kid's strong enough
to hack it all on his own.

256
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:49,590
No.

257
00:16:49,673 --> 00:16:51,480
If we help in nurturing his gifts,

258
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:55,189
then he will undoubtedly become
someone quite extraordinary.

259
00:16:56,060 --> 00:16:56,890
Oh-ho!

260
00:16:56,973 --> 00:16:57,972
You're right about that.

261
00:16:58,600 --> 00:17:03,277
I had no idea he was going through the
same thing at all the other schools, too.

262
00:17:03,360 --> 00:17:07,137
We should all give him guidance
and the training that he deserves.

263
00:17:07,220 --> 00:17:10,044
That young man is overflowing
with such promise.

264
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,100
I have no objection.

265
00:17:12,840 --> 00:17:16,537
Although it means I cannot recruit
him to the intelligence agency.

266
00:17:16,620 --> 00:17:18,840
I am of the same opinion as Saiyan.

267
00:17:19,220 --> 00:17:20,100
I agree.

268
00:17:20,880 --> 00:17:22,762
Yeah, well, of course you would.

269
00:17:23,040 --> 00:17:24,200
How about you, Sig?

270
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:31,097
I'm heading off on a search
to find him now. Hey? Whoa?

271
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:34,357
Now I understand your
eagerness but please calm down.

272
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:40,877
Now just to be clear as the sovereign
six we will all raise the boy as a group.

273
00:17:40,960 --> 00:17:42,317
You all agree? Yes.

274
00:17:42,400 --> 00:17:46,780
Now then let's go find this
young prodigy right away.

275
00:17:56,740 --> 00:17:58,397
Well looky here? Nor?

276
00:17:58,480 --> 00:17:59,310
Hey?

277
00:17:59,393 --> 00:18:01,197
I'm glad you're safe. Yeah?

278
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:04,717
I made it somehow found this
lying on the ground. Oh?

279
00:18:04,800 --> 00:18:07,057
It must have flown off in the attack.

280
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:08,317
Thanks a lot.

281
00:18:08,400 --> 00:18:09,777
So uh?

282
00:18:09,860 --> 00:18:11,697
Suppose you're well on your way to?

283
00:18:11,780 --> 00:18:12,721
through already.

284
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:16,760
And then you saw what was
happening and came back. Sorta.

285
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:17,820
I heard the

286
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:19,717
news and turned around.

287
00:18:19,800 --> 00:18:21,017
You're all caked in mud.

288
00:18:21,100 --> 00:18:22,537
And your clothes are burnt up.

289
00:18:22,620 --> 00:18:23,680
It was a hectic

290
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:25,030
day.

291
00:18:25,113 --> 00:18:26,840
I kind of got into some stuff. Yeah.

292
00:18:27,180 --> 00:18:28,277
Sorry to hear that.

293
00:18:28,360 --> 00:18:30,140
I had a pretty bad time too.

294
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:31,230
Everybody

295
00:18:31,860 --> 00:18:33,077
here is in the same boat.

296
00:18:33,160 --> 00:18:33,990
What a mess.

297
00:18:34,120 --> 00:18:35,477
Man, I am worn out.

298
00:18:35,560 --> 00:18:36,520
I'm about that.

299
00:18:36,840 --> 00:18:38,120
I hate to do this to

300
00:18:38,640 --> 00:18:39,470
you, kid.

301
00:18:39,553 --> 00:18:40,877
Especially since you're all beat to hell,

302
00:18:40,960 --> 00:18:43,877
but the foreman was looking
all over the place for you.

303
00:18:43,960 --> 00:18:47,397
He needs you to haul away some rubble
and help build some temporary housing.

304
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:49,517
That's exactly why I came by, actually.

305
00:18:49,600 --> 00:18:50,430
Where

306
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,390
is he?

307
00:18:51,473 --> 00:18:53,340
I'll get you a map. One sec.

308
00:19:00,220 --> 00:19:02,044
Having you back is a huge help.

309
00:19:02,820 --> 00:19:05,397
When you're here, our
progress is off the charts.

310
00:19:05,480 --> 00:19:07,539
I'm glad I can still be of service.

311
00:19:10,260 --> 00:19:13,300
Whew, man, what a crazy day.

312
00:19:15,200 --> 00:19:19,260
I went on a ride in a
carriage, met a demon folk.

313
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:24,957
I got to fly with Lin's amazing magic,

314
00:19:25,040 --> 00:19:31,380
and then I got to fly
again by Lin's magic.

315
00:19:32,140 --> 00:19:35,757
And some other stuff
happened but flying around

316
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:38,369
all over the place is
what I remember most.

317
00:19:40,360 --> 00:19:42,657
I'm gonna need something
to eat and get some rest

318
00:19:42,740 --> 00:19:48,020
soon but no time for that
yet there's work to do.

319
00:19:50,100 --> 00:19:54,017
I'm sure you already figured it
out but the theocracy of Mithra.

320
00:19:54,100 --> 00:19:59,060
Were the ones working behind the scenes
with Doritas on waging this war. I did.

321
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:03,777
From the Minotaur incident to the Empire's
weaponry, the high-purity monostones,

322
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:08,036
which can only be produced in Mithra,
have been a factor at every turn.

323
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:10,640
I fear our future will not be peaceful.

324
00:20:13,600 --> 00:20:17,200
However, there are people
our nation can depend on.

325
00:20:34,480 --> 00:20:36,337
And most importantly,

326
00:20:36,420 --> 00:20:41,880
we are blessed to have a new friend.

327
00:20:43,940 --> 00:20:45,680
Oh, boy.

328
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,680
Instructor!

329
00:20:54,060 --> 00:20:56,537
Thank you so much for
everything you did yesterday.

330
00:20:56,620 --> 00:20:58,720
You're a real hero, you know that?

331
00:20:59,000 --> 00:21:04,340
I know it was hard for you, but you're
still here, handing out supplies. I am.

332
00:21:04,760 --> 00:21:07,717
I've also been treating those
who are injured as well.

333
00:21:07,800 --> 00:21:10,057
I see you're helping with the restoration.

334
00:21:10,140 --> 00:21:10,970
Yeah.

335
00:21:16,880 --> 00:21:18,560
Well, you are in luck.

336
00:21:18,720 --> 00:21:22,249
I'm handing these out to
everybody, so please help yourself.

337
00:21:22,440 --> 00:21:24,460
Can I really? By all means.

338
00:21:25,200 --> 00:21:26,030
Thanks.

339
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,826
I better get back to it then.

340
00:21:29,060 --> 00:21:31,220
So goodbye for now. See you soon.

341
00:21:32,280 --> 00:21:33,110
Okay then.

342
00:21:33,193 --> 00:21:34,240
Take care, Lin. Bye!

343
00:21:34,520 --> 00:21:36,932
Don't work yourself too hard, instructor.

344
00:21:41,020 --> 00:21:44,549
Man, I wouldn't be where I am
without so many people's help.

345
00:21:46,240 --> 00:21:47,070
Nice!

346
00:21:47,980 --> 00:21:49,960
I can move so much better now.

347
00:21:50,640 --> 00:21:53,460
This really is a good, sturdy sword.

348
00:21:54,020 --> 00:21:58,432
It's a shame it won't see very much
flashy action with me holding on to it.

349
00:21:59,680 --> 00:22:03,840
But maybe one day, I'll finally
get to be an adventurer.

350
00:22:04,320 --> 00:22:08,085
And we can have epic journeys
like the heroes in the storybooks.

351
00:22:08,320 --> 00:22:10,080
The ones like Dad read to me.

352
00:22:11,600 --> 00:22:15,740
But for the time being, I'll
put you to good use here. Nord!

353
00:22:17,460 --> 00:22:19,637
We've cleared out enough in this area!

354
00:22:19,720 --> 00:22:21,597
Are you good to keep working elsewhere?

355
00:22:21,680 --> 00:22:23,640
Yeah, sure, no problem.

356
00:22:29,860 --> 00:22:30,690
Harry!

357
00:22:47,700 --> 00:22:48,617
Oh well.

358
00:22:48,700 --> 00:22:51,840
Well, I guess this is where
we really belong anyway.

359
00:23:18,700 --> 00:23:20,697
I love you, I love you.

360
00:23:20,780 --> 00:23:22,133
I love you, I love you.

361
00:23:24,700 --> 00:23:28,880
I love you, I love you. Give me.
